"""Existing-only resource: composite identity and a CLI-specific read contract.

The unchanged lifecycle owns sequencing and settlement. This hook subject has
no engine Resource, HTTP transport, state option, creation or deletion route.
The fixture implements a conditional update under a file lock. Each product
must qualify its own native identity and concurrency protections.
"""

